                "4": "This position is a favorable one for new initiatives and start something new, especially real estate and properties. It will bless you with positive thoughts, success and family happiness. You will enjoy great financial status with a regular source of income.\n\nMars will bless you with the favor of luck to get financial stability. Also, if Mars is afflicted, it will cause challenges in relationships due to unfavorable financial decision, so its better to listen to the suggestion of your partner in money matters. If afflicted, it will be wise to avoid any major investment and lending money to anyone.",
                "5": "Your patience and practical approach will help you get success on the professional front. You will get recognition and appreciation for your hard work. You will have excellent intellectual skills which will give you sharp mind to earn from wise investments.\n\nYou will enjoy a sweet bond with your partner and a cordial relationship with your colleagues and seniors at workplace. In your marital life, there will be a great understanding between you and your partner. If afflicted, there might be challenges and clashes of opinion, you need to work on your relationship with a positive approach.",
                "6": "This placement will bless you with the company of helpful people who will help you in your success. Your approach at work will help you to get expected career growth. Proper research will give you clarity so that you will make the right decision at the right time.\n\nYour creative ideas will give you expected growth and success. You would win all competitive exams and will excel in your field. If afflicted, you will suffer from chronic illness. You will face disheartening incidents through others. You might not have courage to face challenges both personally and professionally.",
                "7": "You will understand the value of commitment in the relationship. You will always remember about your past romantic memories which can heighten and deepen your sexual relationships.\n\nAll you need is slow, careful, and steady attitude that will create a long-term bond between both of you. You will see it strengthening, which will give you lot of good memories with each other. If afflicted, there will be ruffles and hurdles in your love life which you should overcome by maintaining patience and calmness. You might face tough situations in relationship and professional area.",
                "8": "At times, you might have a feeling that you haven\u2019t still understood your partner. Your expectations towards your partner might remain unfulfilled, which you will accept and let go. You will act maturely in your relationship to maintain harmony and balance.\n\nThrough your psychic ability you would come to know the real intentions and motives of the people. You will take necessary actions to keep up the promise with your partner. At times, anger might disturb the momentum with your partner. You will create a balance between professional and personal life. If afflicted, you will become jealous of other\u2019s growth. You would not have a committed relationship.",
                "9": "Your courage and consistent effort will give you financial growth. You will be inclined towards spirituality. With the blessing of elders and support of mentors, you will find success on personal and professional fronts. But you need to give free space in your relationships, both at the personal and professional life.\n\nYou will ensure positive responses even in the worst of situations. You will be blessed with the expected rank and profile at workplace. Ignorance in terms of expenses could cause you financial loss, so be careful regarding money matters. If afflicted, you would not have good relationship with your parents.",
