        "retrogradeEffect": "Retrogression of Mars may lead to miscarriage, abortion, injuries, and accidents. It creates irresponsibility towards life. It may also induce aggression which can lead to psychopathic behavior and be involved in physical and verbal abuse. Mars might lead to any cuts, wounds, and surgeries in the body. You may go through issues related to anger and hatred.",
        "combustEffect": "Combusted Mars may prompt physical and psychological issues. You may have to face anger issues which can ruin your growth. There will be differences of opinions in marriage and you may be physically abusive to others and get into legal troubles. Combust Mars in Capricorn may create obstruction, distress, depression, sorrow, sickness and can bring adversaries into a human\u2019s life.",
