                "2": "You prefer being a free spirit in your workplace and taking decisions on your own. Your head strong and direct approach needs to be balanced to maintain harmony in your personal relationships. You must include your partner\u2019s valuable input in all major decisions.\n\nThis position of Mars will influence you to be more vocal about the present situation, and this will also influence decision-making ability. You will take bold financial and family decisions which will affect your long-term finances. You will feel strengthened and empowered, but do not get overwhelmed and get into arguments and clashes on your personal and professional front.",
