                "4": "This placement creates financial stability which will make you learn many avenues to invest your money and to get good returns especially in real estate and fixed assets. This placement will bring happiness and abundance to your personal life.\n\nYou will take the lead of your life and inspire others, through your growth and confidence. You will grab the opportunities to make money with your resources. Furthermore, your mother will influence and support you. There will be harmony and good understanding with your family members and loved ones. If afflicted, you will face financial difficulties and unhappiness in life.",
                "5": "You are courageous and determined towards your goals. Through your hard work and perseverance, you will expand your business and achieve financial freedom by taking important decisions. Mars in Capricorn will help you enjoy travelling and spend more time with your loved ones.\n\nYou will have a good understanding with your partner and will share common thoughts and ideas. This position will activate your sexual life and will increase physical and emotional relationship with your partner. If afflicted, you may be triggered with anger issues. You must enjoy your achievements with your family members and seek blessings from elders to create beautiful memories.",
                "6": "Mars will give you confidence and valor to win in all competitions and to work in a high-profile job. This placement will help you overcome pent-up emotions and achieve targets by planning and analyzing tasks. This placement brings out high energy and aggression to do multiple tasks in your job. Also, you will keep up the demand with your self-effort and hard work.\n\nThis planetary position might give you support from government authorities and seniors. If afflicted, you may face health issues related to blood. You may also face anger issues and indulge in conflicts and fights.",
                "7": "This placement creates memorable moments in your relationship. You will light the fire of passion with your partner and cherish small moments, turning them into beautiful memories. Your dedication and hard work will not go unnoticed by your superiors. This placement will bring recognition to your expertise and will bestow you with a well-deserved status.\n\nIf afflicted, you will be angry and have other negative emotions towards your partner, creating disharmony in your relationship. You might become aggressive and your microscopic view in your relationship can create distance.",
                "8": "You will be lucky in property and legal matters. You will be passionate and ambitious in your life, for your personal and professional goals. You will have a jovial time with your partner, and even though there might be differences of opinions at times, you will seek it out amicably.\n\nYou will have the power to delegate work to others. You will achieve all your aspirations through hard work and determination. You will perform deep study and research work in your favorite subjects. If afflicted, you will control your partner and will lead an impractical life.",
                "9": "You will be inclined to do more work and spend extra time with your intellectual skills. You will work harder than others to achieve your targets. You will achieve important business clients and achieve financial gains. You will put efforts into widening your networking skills to bring more money in your business.\n\nYour partner will be supportive and give you ample attention, enhancing the bond between both of you. If afflicted, you will perform unproductive work and will not be able to reach your goal. You might hold on to grudges and will not forget and forgive others.",
